{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05385","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 褚秀","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"讲习延东观，趋陪盛北宫。\n惟师恢帝则，敷教叶天工。\n宣室恩尝异，金华礼更崇。\n洞门清永日，华绶接微风。\n萐降尧厨翠，榴开舜酒红。\n文思光万宇，高议待升中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚秀","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05385.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05385","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}